  "description": "Deck API: # Deck API makes it straightforward for users to connect to any portal securely and quickly.<br /><br />\n### Welcome! Looking for a quick introduction to our API? Check out the 🚀<a href=\"https://framework.docs.deck.co/docs/setup\">Quickstart guide</a>.<br /><br />\nStarting on the sandbox server is easy:<br /><br />\n1. Create an account using the <a href=\"https://dashboard.deck.co\">dashboard</a> to get your client id and sandbox secret<br />\n2. Enter your client id and sandbox secret in the Authentication section below<br />\n3. Hit the \"Try\" buttons below for each endpoint.<br /><br />\nHappy querying!",
